      "m_displayImage1": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Hierophant schemes, but she will be outwitted by the Fool. And, yes, Magician, that Fool is me. I haplessly opened the Scholomance.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_050.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I proved it was possible to follow Balaur's path and it showed me... myself, as it will show you.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_051.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "For the Scholomance is not a physical place and cannot be reached through conventional means. There is no road, there is only a path.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_052.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "It is trapped twixt Life and Death and that path is personal, unique to us all. And thus the rituals necessary to navigate it vary for each person.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_053.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And finding those rituals is... difficult. I buried myself in experiments with time and spirit. As for you... how would you find the truth of yourself?",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_054.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I can... actually help with that, but it will take a while. We can summon a shadow of yourself, Wizard, the ineffable reflection of your soul.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_103.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You have entreated the wellspring of Shadow and gathered its substance. Then the Ritual of Balaur can begin.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_056.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
