  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-002_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You arrive here with Sister Grim-Omen and expect me to believe you offer anything else? Do you even realize, child, with whom you travel?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_PriestessF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Hierophant_DM-BLACK_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700034,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-002_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Keziah? No, that may be the epithet with which she bridled herself. But that is not her title, not her true self.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_PriestessF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Hierophant_DM-BLACK_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700034,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-002_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She is Grim-Omen. She walked the Path of Balaur and discovered the Scholomance. And if she were to do it again... I could be convinced to let you live.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_PriestessF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Hierophant_DM-BLACK_019.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700034,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-002_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You and the wayward apprentice. But know this, mortal, deceive me, or fail me, and I will introduce you to such suffering, Bartleby will feel it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_PriestessF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/The_Hierophant_DM-BLACK_020.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700034,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I don't know much about finding the Scholomance, but I do know how to summon a Shadow Self. Something personal doesn't mean something physical.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_105.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There is nothing more personal than a story. Like, how once upon a time, there was a girl. She didn't have a name, but she was raised by witches.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_106.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They took her when she was very little, too little to remember, and made her their apprentice. They were shaping her into something wicked.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_107.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And she figured it out, right here, at this lake, delving into secrets the witches wanted forgotten. She faced herself, what she would become...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_108.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And she fled, found the Outsiders, took a real name. She called herself Velma and she kept studying forbidden things, and dedicated her life to them.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_109.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That's my story, my real story, one I don't like to tell, but that's what the ritual needs. So take your time, tell your own.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_110.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_111.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wow. Thank you for that. And don't worry, that will stay between you, me and the Shadows. Speaking of, you need one more thing.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_112.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "See those Blobs? They're congealed shades that ooze out of the lake. Take from them the Shadow Substance from which your Shadow Self can form.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-BLACK_113.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
